    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The formula HCF × LCM = Product of Numbers holds TRUE ONLY for TWO numbers, not three or more.",
        "Always simplify fractions to their lowest form before calculating their HCF or LCM.",
        "In word problems, terms like 'maximum', 'greatest', or 'largest tile' indicate HCF, while 'minimum', 'least', or 'bells ringing together' indicate LCM."
